        "cooked": "<p>Hey, everyone! There's a new moderator in town, and he's ready to take care of things in a way that only an Aussie with blue hair can.</p><p>Everyone give huge greetings to <strong>PeterCHayward</strong>! He's going to be largely focusing on the Playtesting forums, so expect to see a lot of him there, if you're one of our playtesters. He'll also be around for other general mod purposes.</p><p>Thanks so much!</p>",
